      ],
      "text": "MCC of anemia in young infants b/n 6 and 9 wks of age"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": ". The cause of physio anemia = the decrease in erythropoiesis ← ↑tissue oxygenation. In a healthy newborn, the hgb level = ↑ to > 14 g/dL. There = a rapid decline that reaches its lowest point, near 11 g/dL, @ b/n 6 and 9 wks."
     }
