            }
           }
          ],
          "text": "Macrocytic Anemia (>100fl)"
         },
         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ": folic acid deficiency, vit B12 deficiency, norm newborn (MCV, 100-125), trisomy 21, meds (ex, valproate, TMP-SMX, hydroxyurea, azathioprine), bone marrow failure (ex, Fanconi anemia), dyserythropoietic anemia, hypothyroidism, liver dz, inborn error of met (ex, orotic aciduria, Lesch-Nyhan syndrome) "
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
         "indLeft": 18,
         "indRight": 0,
         "indFirst": -18,
