         }
        },
        "content": [
         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "To evaluate for nutritional deficiencies causing macrocytic anemia, consider obtaining RBC or serum folate, MMA, & homocysteine:"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
         "indLeft": 36,
         "indRight": 0,
         "indFirst": -18,
         "spaceBefore": 0,
         "spaceAfter": 0,
         "line": null,
         "align": "left",
         "shade": null,
         "borders": null,
         "marker": {
          "text": "o",
          "font": "Courier New",
          "marks": [],
          "tabPt": 18
         }
        },
        "content": [
         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "B12 = a cofactor in the met of MMA & homocysteine, & both are therefore "
         },
         {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
           {
            "type": "highlight",
            "attrs": {
             "hex": "FFFF00"
            }
           }
          ],
          "text": "↑"
         },
         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "in vit B12 deficiency"
         }
        ]
